### Open this file in Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client) and click "Send Request".
@api = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Approve one leave (works everywhere)
POST {{api}}/leaves/7/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "Ali Khan",
  "fromDate": "2026-10-26",
  "toDate": "2026-10-28",
  "approvedBy": "Jaffar"
}

### 2. Approve a leave for employee 26: payroll succeeds, notifications retries 3x then parks it
POST {{api}}/leaves/26/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. Approve 50 leaves at once (watch the queues in the UI, run 2 payroll workers)
POST {{api}}/leaves/bulk?count=50

### 4. Move parked notification messages back into the main queue
POST {{api}}/admin/redrive/notifications.leave-approved
